---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'March 1, 2025';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Read the AppScoutHub privacy policy to learn what data we collect, how it's used, and your rights."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-ink-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-500">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="prose prose-slate mt-8 max-w-none dark:prose-invert">
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how AppScoutHub ("we", "us", or "our") collects, uses, and protects information
        when you visit appscouthub.com (the "Site").
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> pages visited, time on site, and general analytics collected via cookies or similar technologies.</li>
        <li><strong>Contact form data:</strong> your name, email address, and message when you contact us directly.</li>
        <li><strong>Newsletter data:</strong> your email address if you subscribe to updates.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. How we use your information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to inquiries submitted through the contact form.</li>
        <li>To send newsletter updates, if you subscribed, which you can unsubscribe from at any time.</li>
        <li>To understand site usage and improve content and performance.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We may use cookies for basic analytics and to remember preferences such as light/dark mode. You can disable
        cookies through your browser settings, though some site features may not work as intended.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Affiliate links</h2>
      <p>
        Some links on this Site are affiliate links. If you click through and make a purchase, we may earn a
        commission at no additional cost to you. This does not affect our editorial opinions or ratings.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        We may use third-party services (such as analytics or email providers) that collect information according
        to their own privacy policies.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Data retention & security</h2>
      <p>
        We retain contact and newsletter data only as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes described above, and
        take reasonable measures to protect it from unauthorized access.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data at any time by contacting us at{' '}
        <a href="mailto:hello@appscouthub.com">hello@appscouthub.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated
        "Last updated" date.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy? Reach out via our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a> or email{' '}
        <a href="mailto:hello@appscouthub.com">hello@appscouthub.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
